{"id":"wtl0z3lx6hcmxf6stzjdf3acb","title":"加州理工学院团队在《Nature Nanotechnology》发表纳米注射器植物细胞递送技术","originalTitle":"Engineered nanosyringes open a new route into plant cells","summary":"加州理工学院团队开发出纳米注射器技术，成功在完整叶组织植物细胞中递送基因编辑酶并验证受体依赖机制。实验显示，当植物细胞表面FLS2受体过表达时，75%的细胞实现荧光标记，而受体缺失时递送失败。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-nanosyringes-route-cells.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T16:40:09.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T18:12:39.395Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T18:12:39.395Z","category":"drug-therapy","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":71,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"d27dab49-ec12-4d19-b13f-db3f2f410816","title":"Caltech团队开发植物细胞纳米注射器递送基因编辑技术"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"d27dab49-ec12-4d19-b13f-db3f2f410816","title":"Caltech团队开发植物细胞纳米注射器递送基因编辑技术"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fSZodOIcXXgA","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}